Wrong (B): Audit workpapers prepared in the ordinary course of an engagement are not litigation-anticipation documents and lack work product protection.
Wrong (D): An engagement letter is a routine business document establishing the professional relationship, not prepared in anticipation of litigation.$EXPL$
