  choices = $EXPL$["No liability exists because proxy disclosures are entirely voluntary under the 1934 Act","Liability arises only if the SEC initiates an enforcement action within one calendar year","The company is liable only if its stock price declined as a direct result of the vote","Officers face liability under Section 14(a) and Rule 14a-9 for misleading proxy solicitations"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
